OL,5,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FSheralyn needs help to relieve her
OL,7,     Fsymptoms of joint pain. Simon has
OL,8,     Fpain in his left shoulder after a
OL,9,     Fnasty bicycle accident.
OL,10,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,11,     FThe staff and patients of
OL,12,     FBarnsley's A&E department are put
OL,13,     Funder the microscope. A man is
OL,14,     Ftreated after being involved in a
OL,15,     Fserious motorbike accident.
OL,16,G2100 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,17,     FCritical care teams race to save
OL,18,     Flives as a 61-year-old is injured
OL,19,     Fin a motorcycle crash, a new mum
OL,20,     Fhaemorrhages days after giving
OL,21,     Fbirth, and a 12-year-old suffers
OL,22,     Fsevere leg injuries.
